      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹8.31 (down from ₹9.94 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹186.6m (down 4.6% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹9.98m (down 16% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 5.3% (down from 6.1% in 3Q 2025). The decrease in margin was driven by lower revenue. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has fallen by 10% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 5% per year, which means it is well ahead of earnings.",
